(CHAPTER 4: RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION \(RAG\) & GROUNDING \(Page 4\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Chapter 4: RAG Systems · Section 4.1 · Page 4]) Tj T*
(Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) decouples parametric model memory from non-) Tj T*
(parametric factual knowledge.) Tj T*
(An LLM trained on a static corpus cannot recall private enterprise data and suffers) Tj T*
(from factual hallucinations when probed beyond its training cutoff.) Tj T*
(RAG implements a strict two-stage pipeline:) Tj T*
(1. Ingestion Phase: Documents are cleaned, segmented into discrete chunks \(e.g., 300) Tj T*
(to 500 words with 10% overlap\), and mapped into dense vector embeddings using an) Tj T*
(embedding model \(e.g., text-embedding-3-small, BAAI/bge-large\).) Tj T*
(2. Retrieval Phase: A user query is embedded into the same vector space. A similarity) Tj T*
(metric \(Cosine Similarity = \(u . v\) / \(||u|| * ||v||\)\) retrieves the Top-K closest) Tj T*
(passages from an Approximate Nearest Neighbor index \(such as Hierarchical Navigable) Tj T*
(Small World, HNSW\).) Tj T*
(3. Augmented Generation Phase: The retrieved passages are injected into the LLM system) Tj T*
(prompt as verified context boundaries. The model is instructed to answer strictly) Tj T*
(using the provided excerpts and cite source sections.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Chapter 4: RAG Systems · Section 4.2 · Page 4]) Tj T*
(Retrieval Guardrails and Grounding:) Tj T*
(To eliminate hallucinations, the retrieval module must verify context relevance before) Tj T*
(generation. If the highest similarity score between the query and the knowledge base) Tj T*
(falls below a strict threshold \(e.g., Cosine Similarity < 0.10 or TF-IDF overlap <) Tj T*
(0.08\), the system flags the query as Out-of-Scope and refuses generation, rather than) Tj T*
(allowing the LLM to invent plausible-sounding false statements.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Chapter 4: RAG Systems · Section 4.3 · Page 4]) Tj T*
(Trade-offs: RAG vs Fine-Tuning \(LoRA\):) Tj T*
(- Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning \(LoRA / QLoRA\) alters model weights by injecting) Tj T*
(low-rank decomposition matrices W = W_0 + \(B * A\) * \(alpha / r\). Fine-tuning excels at) Tj T*
(teaching tone, syntax, dialect, or strict formatting styles, but is brittle for) Tj T*
(factual recall and cannot dynamic update when files change daily.) Tj T*
(- RAG updates instantly without gradient computation or GPU retraining simply by) Tj T*
(adding or removing documents from the vector store. RAG provides deterministic,) Tj T*
(verifiable citations that can be inspected and audited by human examiners.) Tj T*
ET
